### Note on the `SourceRows` Link:
Because the display text inside `=HYPERLINK("#gid=...&range=A2", "2,3")` is wrapped in quotes inside the formula, Google Sheets keeps `"2,3"` as an exact text label while still letting the formula evaluate as a clickable link.
